Package: nexus-air
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Maintainer: Nexus Air Linux Contributors <info@example.com>
Description: Linux driver and GTK4 GUI for Claw's Nexus Air V1 gaming mouse
 Nexus Air Linux is a reverse-engineered Linux driver, command line tool,
 and modern GTK4 configuration GUI for Claw's Nexus Air V1 wireless and wired
 gaming mouse. Supports full DPI stages, per-stage RGB colors, polling rate,
 debounce, motion sync, angle snapping, sleep timers, and profile switching.
